{"id":"n58158-3-7","stage":2,"title":"들어서다 · 出现","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58158-3-7-1","ko":"극장이 있던 자리에 백화점이 들어섰네요.","zh":"原来剧院所在的地方现在建成了百货商场啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"극장이","meaning":"剧场，戏院","explanation":"극장：剧场，戏院；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"극장","audio":"/audio/2da495228ef48b2e8892.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31667","senseId":"1","lemma":"극장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있던","meaning":"在","explanation":"있다：在；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"8","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자리에","meaning":"位置，位子，地方","explanation":"자리：位置，位子，地方；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"자리","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60332","senseId":"1","lemma":"자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"백화점이","meaning":"百货商店","explanation":"백화점：百货商店；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"백화점","audio":"/audio/655eab9f02534cf0ba14.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26844","senseId":"1","lemma":"백화점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어섰네요.","meaning":"出现，建造","explanation":"들어서다：出现，建造；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"들어서다","audio":"/audio/cd557fcd2d341085e663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58158","senseId":"3","lemma":"들어서다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2da495228ef48b2e","term":"극장","zh":"剧场，戏院","audio":"/audio/2da495228ef48b2e8892.mp3","entryId":"31667","definition":"具有进行话剧、音乐、舞蹈等表演或放映电影的设施的地方。","pronunciation":["극짱"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"在","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"某物占有某处位置或空间。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"0f4adfe312e61750","term":"자리","zh":"位置，位子，地方","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3","entryId":"60332","definition":"人或东西所占据的空间。","pronunciation":[